# 📚 Team and Task Management System API

A basic Team and Task Management System built using:

- Node.js
- Express.js
- TypeScript
- MongoDB Atlas
- JWT Authentication
- Role-based Authorization (Admin / User)

---

# 🚀 Base URL

http://localhost:3000/api


---

# 🏗️ Architecture


- Controllers handle HTTP requests
- Services contain business logic
- Queries handle database operations
- MongoDB Atlas used as database
- JWT used for authentication

---

# ⚙️ Setup Instructions

## 1️⃣ Clone Repository

git clone https://github.com/sznaz/task-andteam-management.git
cd task-andteam-management/server

## 2️⃣ Install Dependencies

npm install


## 3️⃣ Create `.env` File

Copy the .env.example file and create a .env file.

cp .env.example .env
## 4️⃣ Run Development Server

npm run dev

Server will start at:

http://localhost:3000



