# 🔐 Authentication Flow (UI)

## Register Page
- Name
- Email
- Password
- Role Selection (Admin / User)
- Client-side validation
- API error handling
- Loading states

## Login Page
- Email
- Password
- JWT stored in localStorage
- Auto redirect to /dashboard
- Global 401 handling via Axios interceptor

---

# 🏠 Dashboard

After login:

/dashboard

## 👑 Admin Dashboard Shows:
- Total Teams
- Total Tasks
- Pending Tasks
- Completed Tasks

## 👤 User Dashboard Shows:
- My Total Tasks
- My Pending Tasks
- My Completed Tasks

Dashboard automatically loads based on role.

---

# 👥 Team Management (Admin Only)

Routes:
/dashboard/teams  
/dashboard/teams/create  

Features:
- View teams in table
- Members count display
- Client-side pagination
- Create new team with:
  - Team Name
  - Multi-select Members
- Role-based route guard (AdminRoute)

Users cannot access this section.

---

# 📋 Task Management

Routes:
/dashboard/tasks  
/dashboard/create-task  

Features:
- Task table with:
  - Title
  - Team
  - Assigned User
  - Status dropdown
  - Due Date
- Inline status update
- Client-side pagination
- Status filter:
  - All
  - Pending
  - Completed
- Role-based task loading:
  - Admin → All tasks
  - User → Own tasks only

---

# 🛡 Route Protection

The UI implements:

- ProtectedRoute → Requires authentication
- AdminRoute → Requires role === "admin"
- Automatic logout on 401 via Axios interceptor

